<title>JAPAN: Japan offers 120 bln yen of 0.7 pct 2-year notes.</title>
<headline>Japan offers 120 bln yen of 0.7 pct 2-year notes.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's Ministry of Finance said on Thursday it was offering 120 billion yen of 0.7 pct 2-year notes through a price competitive auction.</p>
<p>The auction will close at noon (0300 GMT) and the results will be announced at 2.30 p.m. (0530 GMT).</p>
<p>The issue date will be December 20, 1996 and maturity date will be December 21, 1998.</p>
</text>
